{"name":"Midas Touch","hex":"#e8bd45","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"touch","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Primarily physical senses.\n To make physical contact with; to bring the hand, finger or other part of the body into contact with. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","To make physical contact with; to bring the hand, finger or other part of the body into contact with. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of touching, especially with the hand or finger.","The faculty or sense of perception by physical contact."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/touch"}],"entries":[{"title":"Midas Touch (book)","blocks":[{"text":"Midas Touch: Why Some Entrepreneurs Get Rich — And Why Most Don't is a non-fiction book about personal finance, co-authored by Donald Trump and Robert Kiyosaki. The book was published in hardcover format in 2011. The coauthors became familiar with each other through mutual work at The Learning Annex, and The Art of the Deal. Trump was impressed by Kiyosaki's writing success with Rich Dad Poor Dad. The coauthors then wrote Why We Want You to be Rich together in 2006, and followed it up with Midas Touch in 2011."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d7/Midas_Touch_Trump_Kiyosaki_book.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midas_Touch_(book)"},{"title":"Midas Touch (Kiss of Life song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Midas Touch\" is a song by South Korean girl group Kiss of Life. The song was released on April 3, 2024, as the lead single from their first single album Midas Touch."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midas_Touch_(Kiss_of_Life_song)"},{"title":"Midas","blocks":[{"text":"Midas was a king of Phrygia with whom many myths became associated, as well as two later members of the Phrygian royal house."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Red-figure_stamnos_Silenos_Mida_440BC_Cropped.jpg/330px-Red-figure_stamnos_Silenos_Mida_440BC_Cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midas"},{"title":"Somatosensory system","blocks":[{"text":"The somatosensory system, or somatic sensory system, is a subset of the sensory nervous system. The main functions of the somatosensory system are the perception of external stimuli, the perception of internal stimuli, and the regulation of body position and balance (proprioception). It is believed to act as a pathway between the different sensory modalities within the body."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/XBio_illustration_%E2%80%93_Somatosensory_System.png/330px-XBio_illustration_%E2%80%93_Somatosensory_System.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Somatosensory_system"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Official_Presidential_Portrait_of_President_Donald_J._Trump_%282025%29.jpg/500px-Official_Presidential_Portrait_of_President_Donald_J._Trump_%282025%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Official_Presidential_Portrait_of_President_Donald_J._Trump_%282025%29.jpg/1280px-Official_Presidential_Portrait_of_President_Donald_J._Trump_%282025%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Official_Presidential_Portrait_of_President_Donald_J._Trump_%282025%29.jpg/500px-Official_Presidential_Portrait_of_President_Donald_J._Trump_%282025%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOfficial_Presidential_Portrait_of_President_Donald_J._Trump_(2025).jpg"}